          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="An increase in shipping_transit_volume boosts trade activity and trade-finance settlements and reduces shipping/insurance risk premia, prompting higher cross-border portfolio and trade-related capital flows into affected corridors and instruments." />
