          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Sustained drops in commercial transit through key routes force exporters and importers to set up bilateral clearing arrangements and routings outside standard correspondent‑bank pipelines, accelerating adoption and integration of non‑SWIFT/alternative payment channels." />
