          <attvalue for="35" value="Heightened US–China tech rivalry drives large, time‑sensitive capital allocations into cloud and data‑center projects in particular jurisdictions, producing observable net cross‑border portfolio and project flows as investors move funds to host countries and away from sanctioned or higher‑risk jurisdictions." />
