          <attvalue for="34" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A rapid uptick in AI infrastructure spending raises near‑term demand for construction, power, semiconductors and logistics, tightening capacity in those markets and causing realized inflation to overshoot prevailing forecasts." />
