          <attvalue for="34" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Sustained flows of Chinese or China-led AI/cloud infrastructure investment into BRICS and partner states create economic dependencies, procurement ties, and regulatory harmonization that translate into quicker diplomatic and strategic alignment toward alternative blocs." />
