          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A measurable increase in domestic semiconductor production capacity provides alternative supply for critical chips, enabling targeted economies to run indigenous hardware stacks and routing/telecom infrastructure that bypasses vendors subject to export controls, directly boosting their ability to evade hardware-dependent sanctions." />
