          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A visible shift by BRICS toward alternative geopolitical alignments prompts the US and allied governments to broaden export controls, investment screening and AI oversight on tech ties with aligned partners, increasing regulatory stringency in the US–China tech rivalry." />
