          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A faster BRICS-alignment by Iran's partners (training, arms transfers, intelligence sharing and diplomatic backing) increases Iran's operational capacity and political willingness to conduct or authorize more maritime harassment and seizures in the Gulf, raising the rate of hostile incidents." />
          <attvalue for="36" value="6-18 months" />
